(text "Plugs into the main board on two 2.54 mm headers. Power pins: 4 per rail, about 3 A each." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9accf0c2-c25a-4a52-ade6-447f328bdb28))
(text "eFuse settings: OVP 31.8 V (255k/10k), current limit 6.0 A (3.01k), UVLO default 15.5 V, about 11 ms soft start at 24 V (22 nF)." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0d400ea9-6e26-46c8-82ad-798d191783e8))
(text "MODE open = latch-off after an overload (default). Close JP to GND for auto-retry. SHDN left open (internal pull-up)." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 29ec3729-ffae-4752-9e1d-e949aa6aef40))
(text "PGTH and PGOOD are tied to GND (power-good unused; TI allows PGOOD at GND). FLT and IMON go to the main board." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid af619000-1599-4499-9470-1086c7f17a20))
(text "Reverse polarity: Q1 blocks it (TI arrangement: Q1 source to IN_SYS, drain to IN, gate to B_GATE; Q2 pulls B_GATE down)." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 21e236d2-f0e0-4b5a-8d99-7ca563cf7405))
(text "TVS SMCJ51CA: stays off with a 48 V supply plugged in by mistake; the eFuse OVP disconnects the board." (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a767f677-dc55-4a50-a920-cf30dcf09067))
(text "TPS7A4901: +5VA = 1.185 V x (1 + 32.4k/10k) = 5.02 V. 10 nF on NR/SS and across the top resistor (CFF)." (at 20.32 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6d745777-809f-4144-b8c8-75e7f5893179))
